  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tri-Partite Partnership supporting National Human Rights Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP (through their Global Programme on Rule of Law and Human Rights), OHCHR and GANHRI (Global Alliance of National Human Rights Institutions (NHRIs) will through this partnership work together to strengthen the capacities of NHRIs, individually and through regional and global networks, to promote and protect human rights. Tematic priorities include NHRI&apos;s efforts towards the 2030 Agenda/ Leave no One Behind (incl. focus on women) and prevention/early warning</narrative>
  </description>
